  <h2 id="next-step">What to do next</h2>

  <p>
    Pick the target role first, then the language. Read ten postings, run the four questions and build one project you can show.
  </p>

  <p><strong>Try it now:</strong> <a href="/services/assessments/skill-gap-assessment/">Run the free skill gap assessment</a> to see which skills your target role needs and where you stand today.</p>


  <p>
    For a first test, spend a focused stretch on one small task in each language, as long as you need, and note which one you finish and enjoy. Some people decide quickly and others need a couple of months, and both are fine.
  </p>

  <p>
    The aim is a high-income skill portfolio: the right skill mix, proof of work, clear communication and a fit with how you work. It does not guarantee a higher salary, but it is the part you can build and show.
  </p>

